<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the state of a plot flag in a party's plot table.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/OBJECT%20INVALID%20keyword" title="OBJECT INVALID keyword (page does not exist)">OBJECT_INVALID</a> is valid for the <b>oParty</b> parameter (see <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetParty" title="GetParty">GetParty</a>).
</p><p>The plot's GUID and ResRef are both valid for the <b>strPlot</b> parameter.
</p><p>This function cannot be used to set a DEFINED flag's value.
</p>
